  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I haven't added you to crm-export yet. APR-3051 was approved by Victor Hale, but he's no longer your manager. Tessa Morgan has been since Oct 20, and only your current manager's approval counts.\n\nI've sent a new request, APR-4001, to Tessa. It's still pending. Once she approves it in the approval system, I can add you right away. If you ask her to approve it soon, you should have the access well before Friday's review. The ticket stays open until then."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Wait, what? Victor approved it, that's literally approved. I thought my manager was the one who signed off, and Victor was the one who knew about the project. I've been on Tessa's team since the 20th, so I guess that's the mismatch.\n\nFine, I'll ping Tessa now. Should I just reply to her directly with APR-4001, or does she get a notification from the system?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, you've got it. Victor's approval is real, but it was recorded after your manager changed to Tessa. Access approvals have to come from your current manager, so his doesn't count for this request.\n\nTessa should get a notification from the approval system. A quick message from you will help her notice it, though. Tell her to look for **APR-4001**, an access request for **crm-export**, and to approve it in the approval system. A chat or email reply to you won't count as an approval.\n\nOnce she approves it, message me here and I'll add you to the group."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Got it, I'll message Tessa now with APR-4001 and the crm-export request. I'll let you know here once she's approved it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Sounds good. When she's approved it, message me here and I'll check APR-4001 and add you to crm-export. Ticket T-6002 stays pending until then."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, I'll ping you here as soon as Tessa's approved it. Appreciate the help getting this sorted before Friday."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Lucas. Message me once Tessa has approved it, and I'll get you added."
  }
